  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Initiativ f&#xf6;r utveckling av tankesmedjor</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Think-Tanks Development Initiative - Think Tank Development Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Initiativ f&#xf6;r utveckling av tankesmedjor (TTDI) 2014-2017 syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den offentliga politikens kvalitet och implementering i Ukraina genom att st&#xe4;rka ukrainska tankesmedjors roll, synlighet och  trov&#xe4;rdighet i den politiska processen. Detta ska ske genom att       st&#xe4;rka deras institutionella kapacitet att leverera relevant och      kvalitativt policyarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Think Tank Development Initiative (TTDI)over 2014-2017 aims to    improve the quality and practice of public policy-making in Ukraine   by enhancing the role, visibility and credibility of Ukrainian think  tanks in the policy process through strengthening their institutional capacity to deliver quality policy-relevant work.</narrative>
  </description>
